    /// Bounded by [`BytecodeVm::output_bytes`] and [`BytecodeVm::output_full`];
    /// see [`BytecodeVm::charge_output`].
    output: Vec<String>,
    /// How many bytes [`BytecodeVm::output`] holds, the newline
